        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="paths" value="PATHS / NOTE&#10;Sunny-day and rainy-day paths&#10;SUNNY: login / dashboard route -&gt; session role -&gt; role summary + own notifications -&gt; cards / meets / outstanding actions -&gt; existing authorized feature. Desktop top nav or mobile hamburger uses the same permissions.&#10;ADMIN / COACH: Admin receives organization statistics and Admin quick actions; Coach monitors all meets and can assign events, record results, edit programs and review availability without Admin-only actions.&#10;ATHLETE: nominated meets + own availability + next published scheduled event. No Pending responses -&gt; All Caught Up; no nominations/schedule -&gt; clear empty state; My Profile and notifications remain accessible.&#10;EMPTY / FAILURE: no upcoming meets, no staff actions or no recent notifications -&gt; section-specific empty state. Failed section -&gt; unavailable message + retry; other accessible sections stay usable.&#10;AUTHORIZATION: wrong-role feature request -&gt; server denies; unrelated athlete records -&gt; denied using linked athlete identity. Role navigation and responsive layouts preserve the same access rules on every device." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=16;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#f7f9fc;strokeColor=#53617b;">
          <mxGeometry x="32" y="1567" width="1836" height="303" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
